# Client build artifacts and deps — never committed (server rule: ws is the only server runtime dep;
# client dev-deps live here and stay here).
node_modules/
web/dist/
desktop/target/
desktop/gen/
# The mobile www/ is the assembled shared bundle (rebuilt by prepare.mjs); the native android/ project
# source IS tracked (deep-link filters, signing config, brand icons) — its own android/.gitignore drops
# the build artifacts / copied web assets / generated config. ios/ is reproducibly generated on Linux/macOS; only Xcode build/signing needs macOS (T-415).
mobile/www/
mobile/ios/
mobile/artifacts/
*.log
